      "id": 108475,
      "name": "Oaktree",
      "username": "Oaktree",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/oaktree/{size}/2287_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-07-05T15:08:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Shock Rounds go off once then destroy themselves. See <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/expatriette - shock - rounds - and - submachine - gun\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this thread</a>.Basically you get the first instance of damage from the gun (whatever that is), Shock Rounds do a point to all non-heroes, Shock Rounds destroy themselves, then the rest of the gun's instances of damage happen (one at a time).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That would then apply to all ammo cards; or do Hollow Points last for the entire burst since they boost the damage power of the gun card itself rather than generating an effect before destroying themselves?</p>\n<p>(And the thread link you supplied appears to be broken)</p>",
