      "id": 108476,
      "name": "pwatson1974",
      "username": "pwatson1974",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-07-05T15:34:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Shock Rounds is worded differently to the others. The others explicitly modify the damage of the power. shock Rounds adds a rider to the power, so you'd resolve the power first, then Shock Rounds would go off and destroy itself.&nbsp; The power is not used until it is finished, so shock Rounds, uniquely among the ammos, goes off after the power.</p>",
